  "description": "WIGQOS crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H126 Eu5 N8 O11,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu1F (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu2F (Eu) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.641-5.215 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.71-154.29°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula H5[Eu5O5(OC6H3iPr2-2,6)6(NCCH3)8]·CH3CN.",
